        "content": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I'm getting a funny CI error I can't figure out on this PR <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/37806\">#37806</a>. I've pasted the output below. Any help would be very much appreciated!</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scripts</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">create_deprecated_modules</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scripts</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">create_deprecated_modules</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">375</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">warning</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">number</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">commits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">look</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">must</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">least</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">!</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Copyright (c) 2025 Damiano Testa. All rights reserved.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Released under Apache 2.0 license as described in the file LICENSE.</span>\n<span