        "content": "<p>My guess that this is <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"287929\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/New.20CI.20job.3A.20.22check.20all.20scripts.20built.20successfully.22/with/584706781\">#mathlib4 &gt; New CI job: \"check all scripts built successfully\"</a>.</p>",
